UNREMORT

   Before you remort, mudmail Proedus that you want your player file backed up.
Proedus will reply within a day or two.  Once you receive confirmation that your
file is backed up, remort at any time.  If you ever decide to unremort,
mudmail Proedus.  The backed up player file will be restored.  Note that the
backup only covers stats (str, dex, hp, mana, etc), not equipment.  It costs
100K to backup a file and 1 million to restore a backup.
