NEWBIE_POTION_ROOM

The old Policy Room under the North Temple in Heliopolis is gone.
In its place is the new Newbie Potion Room, where all your brewed
potions go when they're donated.  Donated potions can only be
quaffed by non-remorts under level 30, and an unused potion decays
after a week.
 
To all old players: To help the newbie population, please donate
all your unused brewed potions.
 
To all new players: Take and use what you need.  When you're done, 
donate the unused potions so that others can use them.
#0
GET_OUT_OF_DEATH_FREE_TOKEN

   A get-out-of-death-free token prevents a character from losing their
equipment and experience points when they die.  Instead, the player is sent to
their recall point.  The token works automatically on the person carrying or
wearing it (even if it's in a container).  The token also prevents the user
from walking or teleporting into into a deathtrap.  Once used, the token
vanishes.
#10
RETOOL

  Are you a new player under level 20 and wished you'd picked
different stats?  Now you can, with the retool command!
 
Say you want one more point in str, and you want to trade a dex
point to get it:
  retool str 1 dex -1
 
  Retool works off the same stat point system as character
creation, so str/int/wis/dex cost 2 "stat points", con costs 3,
and charisma costs 1.  You can only change two stats at a time,
and the change must be zero "stat points".  For example, the
following are all valid:
  retool wis 3 con -2
  retool con -1 cha 3
  retool dex 1 int -1
  retool cha -2 str 1
 
Make sure you're happy with your stats before you hit level 21,
they're final.
#0
REMORT_TEST HERO_TEST ANGEL_TEST AVATAR_TEST

OVERVIEW
  Once a player reaches level 100, he or she must pass an automated test called
a remort test to continue leveling.  The test consists of three parts which must
be passed in sequence.  They are entirely automated and require no immortal
intervention.
.
WHAT
  A non-remort who passes the Hero remort test advances to level 101.
  A 1st-remort who passes the Angel remort test advances to level 102.
  A 2nd-remort who passes the Avatar remort test advances to level 103.
.
WHERE
  All remort tests occur in Aethelfyrd below the statue of Cymynedd.
.
NOTE
  The automated remort tests added a lot of code that may contain bugs.  Please
report anything out of the ordinary to an immortal.  No refunds will be given
unless an immortal is actively snooping your test.
.
PART 1 - REQUIREMENTS
  * There is no gold cost and no penalty for failing this part.
  * Be level 100 and have negative experience points.
  * Exploration requirement (25% for Hero, 37.5% for Angel, 50% for Avatar)
  * Skills:
      Hero: 6 skills (take part one at any time, even before level 100 to see
        what these are)
      Angel: All skills/spells at good/7 except mount, riding and fishing.
      Avatar: All skills/spells at superb/10 except mount, riding and fishing.
.
PART 2 - TRIVIA
  * Costs 500K for Hero, 750K for Angel, 1mil for Avatar.  Gold is returned if
      you pass.
  * You are asked 10 multiple choice questions, you need 7 correct to pass.
  * You have 90 seconds to answer each question.
  * After incorrectly answering 4 questions, you fail.
  * If you fail, you must wait one real-time week before taking this part again.
  * You may ask other players for general hints after the test, but nothing
      specific.  Keep the questions to yourself.
.
  If you fail the trivia part, you will be asked 3 of the 4 missed questions
the next time you take the test.  Therefore it is highly beneficial that you
explore and find the answers you missed.  Write the questions down and use the
multiple choice answers to your advantage.
.
PART 3 - BATTLE
  * This part requires the same amount of on-hand gold as part 2.  If you pass,
      your gold is returned to you.
  * You must defeat a challenging mob in combat by yourself.
  * If you fail, you must wait one real-time week before taking this part again.
  * If you kill the mob, you automatically pass.
  * Do not drop any objects in the combat area that you want to keep.
