EXPLORED
   The rooms you've visited are recorded when you walk around.  You can find
out how much you've explored by typing "score".  The "Explored" entry tells
you how many rooms you've visited in the world.  The "Explored Zone" entry
tells you how much of the current zone you've visited.  To see the names of
every zone you've visited, go to the Wise Man in Fineash and type "list".
