SHOP_NOTES


* see &Whelp shop_commands&n for using a shop.
 
  If you want to buy a shop, mudmail Lucas a room title, a room desc (minimum 3 lines),
have 5.1 mil in your bank account (not on-hand gold), and know where you want to
put your shop.
 
Notes for Owners
--------------------------
* 5 million coins to buy.
  Includes the room and the room description.
* 500K to change the room description (max 1x per week).
* 100K per calendar month in rent
* 25% sales tax on each purchase (as the benefit of being able to
  sell objects 24/7, 365 days a year).
* Buyers must have enough gold on-hand to buy an item.  The gold
  (minus the sales tax) is deposited in the owner's bank account.
* 100 objects per shop.
* One shop per character.
* One shop per room.
* Shop location is subject to approval by an imm (and at least 15 rooms
  away from any town).
* Only shop owner can add/remove items.
* Anyone with enough gold can buy anything you list for sale.
* Objects must be listed between 10 coins and 40 million coins.
* Can't sell containers with objects, no-rent objects, or keys.
* Rent is collected near midnight on the first of each (real) month.
  If the shop owner's bank account (not on-hand gold) does not cover
  the rent, the shop is closed.  This means you can't add more items
  and people can't buy items (although you can remove existing items).
* Once a shop is closed, it costs 2x the monthly rent to re-open, seek
  immortal assistance.
* If a shop remains closed due to insufficient rent for longer than
  six months, the shop and any contents will be deleted.
 
Notes for Everyone
--------------------
* If you find a bug related to shops, anything suspicious, out of
  the ordinary, anything you might consider an abuse, or a
  potential abuse, report it immediately by mud-mail to Lucas,
  or board 4.  If there is any evidence a player knows of a bug
  and does not report it, I will delete the player on the spot.
  No questions asked.  THIS MEANS YOU.
