#0
SMITE PLINK FLUX

Usage:

> flux
restores hp/mana/move of all characters to full

> smite <victim>
knocks the hp/mana/move of the victim to 1/1/1

> plink <victim>
knocks 100 hp/mana/move off of the victim

Flux is similar to restore, except that it fully regens all
players on the mud.  Plink and Smite are used to knock hp/mana/move
off of a single player.  Smite will reduce them all to 1, while Plink
knocks 100 off of each, but won't go below 1/1/1.  Be aware that
Smiting/Plinking a player that is in a fight might get the killed real
quick, so use caution.
