Shows the last two pages of syslog before the mud has crashed or rebooted.
Useful for viewing the syslog devoid of the spam that is created at reboot.

See Also: VBUGS VCHANGES VTYPOS VIDEAS VSYSLOG VSCRIPTERR VGOLD
