#104
portalmaster
   Portalmasters are scattered across the world and, for a price, will
teleport mortals from one place to another.  A gnome portalmaster is available
in Sundhaven for those who want to visit the UnderDark city of Keorc Koilos.
Another is located in Keorc Koilos to assist in return trips to the surface.
  
#0
keorc
   The primary city of the UnderDark.  All of the basic needs, from shops to a
healer, are available here.    
#0
underdark
   The UnderDark is a vast underground realm built largely in three levels.  
The lower you go, the more difficult it becomes.  Keorc Koilos is the primary
city and offers such ammenities as shops, a healer, a banker, guildmasters,
and a residential area for homes.  Access points are few, though a
portalmaster may be able to assist you.    
