SPECS SPEC_PROCS

The following is a list of special procedures and what they do. 
It will also give some examples of how to use them on a mob.


ARCHER - Fires arrows into an adjacent room.   When using the 
   Archer spec you must post to the board the room vnum the archer
   will be in and the vnums of adjacent rooms into which they
   will fire.

BREATH_ACID, BREATH_FIRE, BREATH_FROST, BREATH_GAS, BREATH_LIGHTNING -
   Use for any mobs which use breath weapons, particularly dragons.

BUTCHER - Takes corpses and makes them into items to be used.

CITYGUARD - Assign this to ALL guards in "player" towns. They will
   attack thieves, come to the aid of battered citizens, and do
   other 'guard' kind of things.  Make sure to also assign the
   CITIZEN flag.

CLEANING - Picks up TRASH objs and grumbles while wandering around..

DRAGON - Casts one of five different breath weapons (Fire, Ice, 
  Lightning, Acid, Gas).  Use only on very powerful mobs (Tiamat
  is an example).  For normal dragons, use one of the BREATH_* specs.

EXECUTIONER - Butch's spec.  Mob will be extremely aggressive to
   player killers and player thieves.  Should be rare and only on a
   powerful mob.

FIDO - Any kind of mob which 'devours' corpses and leaves the
   contents behind.

GUILD - Allows players to gain and practice.  This might change in
   the future when levelling and training become class/race/level
   specific.

GUILD_GUARD - A 'blocker' mob.  When using, post to the board the
   class(es) which will be allowed to pass (can be none), the room
   vnum the guard resides in, and the direction to be blocked.

HEALER - Casts beneficial spells on players for a price.  Should
   be fairly rare.

HOME - Allows a player to change their hometown.  Should be no more
   than one hometown mob per town or city where players could
   rent out.

JANITOR - Picks up stuff left on the ground, including corpses.

LEVIATHAN - Casts ice storm, meteor storm, earthquake, and heals
   himself.  Used in Oceania along with the SEA_SERPENT.

MAGIC_USER - Casts wizard spells.  Note: Make all mobs flagged
   with this spec as class magic_user as this spec will eventually
   be replaced.

MAYOR - A fairly complex mob which wanders and does stuff.  This
   mob no longer functions due to the re-engineering of Midgaard.
   Probably should be removed.

POSTMASTER - Allows players to send and receive mudmail.  A must 
  for every player city.

PRIEST - Casts priest spells.  Note: Make all mobs flagged with
   this spec as class cleric as this spec will eventually be replaced.

PUFF - The annoying mob which resides in Limbo.  Do NOT use.

RECEPTIONIST and CRYOGENIST - Allows players to rent, rather than 
   camp.  Currently not used.

ROBIN_HOOD - Used for Robinhood and Tuck.  Steals money from the
   rich and gives to the poor.  Do NOT set ever.

SEA_SERPENT - Casts fireball.  Used in Oceania along with the LEVIATHAN.

SHOP_KEEPER - The mud will set this for you.  DO NOT SET EVER.

SNAKE - Will bite and poison if saving throw fails.  Use on 
   snakes, spiders, scorpions, etc.

THIEF - Steals from people.  The cityguards and the thieves 
   probably will end up pounding on each other.

TRAINER, QUESTMOB - Converts points to statistics.  These should
   probably not be set and will most likely be removed.

OTHER:
The following specs are used in the King Welmar zone.  They are 
provided as an example of what can be done with spec procs.  
CASTLEGUARD, JAMES, DICKNDAVID, TIM, TOM, KING_WELMAR, 
TRAINING_MASTER, PETER, JERRY

See also: OASIS OLC
#104
WEAP_PROF

Weapon Proficiencies are a new feature in Phoenix 4.0.  With weapon profs,
players can specialise in certain types of weapons which give them bonuses
to hit and to damage an opponent.  In order for the proficiencies to work
properly, any weapons you create MUST have the proper weapon type set.  The
following table shows how weapon types relate to weapon proficiencies.

Weapon Type	   2-Handed	   	1-Handed
----------------------------------------------------
BLUDGEON           2-Handed Club   	Club
MAUL		   2-Handed Club   	Club
 
PIERCE		   Spear		Dagger
PIERCE_NO_BS	   Spear		Dagger
STING		   Spear		Dagger

STAB		   2-Handed Sword	Dagger

SLASH		   2-Handed Sword	Sword
BITE		   2-Handed Sword	Sword
THRASH		   2-Handed Sword	Sword

BLAST		   Whip			Whip
WHIP		   Whip			Whip

CLAW		   Claw			Claw

POUND		   2-Handed Hammer	Hammer

CLEAVE		   2-Handed Axe		Axe

HIT		   Fisticuffs		Fisticuffs
PUNCH		   Fisticuffs		Fisticuffs
ALL OTHERS	   Fisticuffs		Fisticuffs
