ADDMEMBER

Usage: addmember <player name>

1. It will cost each and every player 35k coins to join a clan.
   This must be coinage on hand. Not in the bank.
2. You must be the leader of a clan to use this command.
3. A character can only be a member of one clan at a time.
4. Whether a player will be allowed to join more than one clan
   with multies is up to the clan leaders involved.
5. The player must be present on the mud to add them.
6. The player must be above level 30 to be in a clan.

See Also: CLANS DELMEMBER CHANGELEADER
