#0
CLANS

To start a clan you will need the following:
--A clan charter approved by the immortals(which inclueds the following)
  --A set of entrance guildelines
  --RP rules of conduct for its members
  --RP purpose for existing
--10 players minimum(not characters)all atleast level 50

Though not strictly enforced all members will be
expected to follow the charter while IC(in character).

Clans must have a minimum of 10 players to stay open.

Each clan will have it's own channel(CSAY) and a message
board available to its members that only they can see.

Each clan will get it's own bank account available with the CDEPOSIT, CBALANCE,
and CWITHDRAW commands. Only the clan leader can withdraw funds from this account.

Clanleaders can add and remove players from thier clans with the ADDMEMBER and
DELMEMBER commands, minumum level for new members is 30. They will also be able
to pass on leadership of the clan to another member with the CHANGELEADER
command, please don't abuse this feature.

Clan names will be shown in () after a persons title in the who list.

All costs associated with clans are available in HELP PRICES.
Please mail Ceria with any requests for clans.

The Immortals reserve the right to disband disruptive clans.

See Also: PRICES ADDMEMBER DELMEMBER CHANGELEADER CSAY CRECALL CDONATE CBALANCE CDONATE CWITHDRAW
