AREAS

Usage: AREAS

This command will display a list of all of the areas accessible on the game.
There are level suggestions displayed as well as the authors of the areas.
Please use caution when exploring unfamiliar areas.  Set your wimpy, carry
recall scrolls, and travel in groups where possible.  Make sure you have
items that will allow you to fly if you are going to be exploring far from
home.
