       drink [from] <item>
       sip [from] <item>

If you're hungry or thirsty, these commands are for you!

  > eat bread
  > taste bread
  > drink from cup
  > sip fountain

Note: You CANNOT eat or drink while you are in combat.  You can, however,
      still quaff potions.
