FORMS "BUILDING FORMS"

All builders are required to fill out the below "Progress" Form each week 
and submit it to the address below every Sunday.  If you cannot be logged 
in on Sunday submit the form no later than Tuesday evening.  Obviously if 
you are out of town you might not be able to submit the form--if this is the 
case make sure to notify your team leader in the previous week's submission.

When you finish with a zone please EMAIL me the "Completed" form.  Upon 
completion of your first regular sized zone you may be transferred to either 
PM1 or PM2 from PM3, depending on the mud's needs.  If you would prefer one 
of these teams over the other for personal reasons please let Cymynedd know 
when you submit your "Completed" form.

The correct addresses to mail these forms to are:

     PM1     pkennedy@innernet.net
     PM2     eschmitt@ebicom.net
     PM3     erika@phoenixmud.net.  

See Also: "PROGRESS FORM" "COMPLETED FORM"

