Usage: pick <lock name> [direction]
 
For picking locks.  Not all locks can be picked.
 
Examples:
 
  > pick door south
  > pick safe
 
See Also : OPEN, CLOSE, LOCK, UNLOCK
#0
"QUIVERING PALM" QUIVERING_PALM

Masters of martial arts can use this skill to hurt their opponents.  
#0
RAGE

This skill will increase your damageroll, hitroll, and armor class during 
the fight. You will not be able to flee while enraged. If you recall while 
enraged you will begin to immediately fight the first mob you see, which 
most likely will be Butch. Be very careful with this skill.
#0
"READ MAGIC"

This skil lets the user read magic scrolls.
#0
