for example, a wild horse.  Note that not all mobs can be ridden.  

See Also: MOUNT DISMOUNT RIDING
#0
"THIRD ATTACK"

Lets the character hit up to three times per fight round.  Actual number of 
hit per round is determined by skill level and a random factor.
